<content>
The Vault sales tracker, pre-configured for this offer. Make your own copy and start logging.
**How to use:** open the sheet below, then **File → Make a Copy**, save it to your Drive, share edit access to Daniel, and paste your copy's link here in the teamspace.
[**➡️ Open The Vault Master Sales Tracker**](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1z5hA65GRci504mYtDGMu1_k5M-KCftXKOwP5wgR4jVo/edit)
## What's inside
- **Follow-Up Pipeline** - chase everyone who hasn't bought yet. Log the objection, deal size, and next follow-up date. Rows due today auto-highlight red.
- **Upsell / Ascension Board** - ascend everyone who HAS bought. Pick their current tier and the sheet auto-shows the next upsell, price, and when they're due.
- **CONFIG tab** - filled for The Vault (sources, objections, UGC niches). NOTE: the tier ladder and ascension map are placeholders ("The Vault" to "Vault Elite") pending Daniel's confirmation of Brady's real upsell path.
</content>
